\textbf{主要參考資料 / Primary Sources}\\
\textbullet\ 老弟兄查經方法論與神學框架之應用（本書無對應之老弟兄羅馬書逐節查經筆記原始記錄；詳見附錄二誠實說明）\\
\textbullet\ John MacArthur - MacArthur New Testament Commentary (gty.org)\\
\textbullet\ G. Campbell Morgan\\[0.8em]

\textbf{核心主題 / Central Theme}\\
保羅寫給羅馬教會最系統的一封信——從普世的罪，到因信稱義的恩典，到聖靈中得勝的新生命，直到教會如何在世上活出這福音。\\
Paul's most systematic letter --- from universal sin, to the grace of justification by faith, to victorious new life in the Spirit, to how the church lives out this gospel in the world.\\[0.8em]

本書為三書精讀項目成果之一。\\
Part of the Three Books Deep Reading Project.
